A simple API built with FASTAPI to manage daily to do list 
This project uses a JSON based local storage system, making it easy to set up 

Quick start
1.Ensure you have Python 3.8+ installed
2.CLone the repository and install the dependencies
3.Run the server: USe tastapi dev main.py
The api will bet live at http://127.0.0.1:8000.
API Endpoints
Tasks
GET /tasks: Retrieve all tasks.
POST /tasks: Create a new task.
Body: {"task": "String"}
PATCH /tasks/{id}/complete: Mark a specific task as done.
DELETE /tasks/{id}: Remove a task permanently.

📖 Documentation
FastAPI automatically generates beautiful interactive documentation for this project:
Use this link  http://127.0.0.1:8000/docs
